{"title": "Pakistan School Roof Collapse Kills Dozens of Students and a Teacher", "summary": "A school roof collapsed in Peshawar, Pakistan, resulting in the deaths of at least 17 students and one teacher, with over 40 others injured. Some reports indicate higher death tolls, with figures ranging up to 29 students and one teacher killed. The collapse occurred during classes, with authorities stating that at least 27 students, most younger than 13, died along with a teacher. The ceiling came down on students after the roof of a higher floor collapsed, crumpling two stories. Building collapses are noted as common in Pakistan due to poor safety standards and construction materials.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "पाकिस्तान में स्कूल की छत गिरने से दर्जनों छात्र और एक शिक्षक की मौत", "summary_hi": "पाकिस्तान के पेशावर में एक स्कूल की छत गिरने से कम से कम 17 छात्रों और एक शिक्षक की मौत हो गई, जबकि 40 से अधिक लोग घायल हो गए। कुछ रिपोर्टों में मौतों की संख्या अधिक बताई गई है, जो 29 छात्रों और एक शिक्षक तक है। यह हादसा कक्षाओं के दौरान हुआ, जिसमें अधिकारियों ने बताया कि कम से कम 27 छात्र, जिनमें से अधिकांश 13 साल से कम उम्र के थे, एक शिक्षक के साथ मारे गए। ऊपरी मंजिल की छत गिरने से छात्रों पर मलबा आ गिरा, जिससे दो मंजिलें ढह गईं। खराब सुरक्षा मानकों और निर्माण सामग्री के कारण पाकिस्तान में इमारतों का ढहना आम बात बताई गई है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["The sole rated outlet reporting this event led with the death toll of 17 children and a teacher."], "center": ["Multiple centrist outlets reported the death toll as 30, with over 40 injured.", "One centrist outlet highlighted the rescue teams' presence."], "right": ["Right-leaning outlets reported death tolls ranging from 27 to 29 students and one teacher.", "One right-leaning outlet specified that the students killed were under 13 years old."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["इस घटना की रिपोर्टिंग करने वाले एकमात्र रेटेड आउटलेट ने 17 बच्चों और एक शिक्षक की मौत की खबर को प्रमुखता दी।"], "center": ["कई सेंट्रिस्ट आउटलेट्स ने मौतों की संख्या 30 बताई, जबकि 40 से अधिक घायल हुए।", "एक सेंट्रिस्ट आउटलेट ने बचाव दलों की उपस्थिति पर प्रकाश डाला।"], "right": ["दक्षिणपंथी आउटलेट्स ने 27 से 29 छात्रों और एक शिक्षक के बीच मरने वालों की संख्या बताई।", "एक दक्षिणपंथी आउटलेट ने विशेष रूप से बताया कि मारे गए छात्र 13 साल से कम उम्र के थे।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/68tk5v/article71586973.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/AFP_D3C67WE.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/students-teacher-killed-in-school-roof-collapse-in-pakistan-peshwar/article71586942.ece", "headline": "17 children, teacher killed, over 40 injured as school roof collapses in Pakistan’s Peshawar", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/18-killed-as-school-roof-collapses-in-pakistans-peshawar/articleshow/134959547.cms", "headline": "28 children, teacher killed as school roof collapses in Pakistan’s Peshawar", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/pakistan-21-students-teacher-killed-after-school-roof-collapses-in-peshawar-12188465", "headline": "27 Students, Teacher Killed After School Roof Collapses In Pakistan", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "Dainik Jagran", "owner": "Jagran Group", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQQzFadjJTX3NRekNidWVBT2VNX2NENzdBcXpfZ25Rd1Q3OGNrQTdCaDZyRVFrRVZuWGltcWRDVFZGcFRuYnk3dmI1clZLRTJ0eUV3ZjJGWGF5cWo3cFNzdnZqRUJ1TUpSaVozQnVWU1pnTlpiRHBXMGhwRktFZUxCNGZiMlNYVTNNUXFweExSRGxta21OWThrdDdvQTRBWjlQeEphdUhaVGlaTnloRUR2TmpXMWpWczY3OFdnM2dkMDVoUFk?oc=5", "headline": "पाकिस्तान के पेशावर में भरभराकर गिरी